WEBVTT

00:00:07.917 --> 00:00:08.958
[Bonnie gasps]

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:13.083
[as Jessie] Hello.

00:00:14.542 --> 00:00:17.125
[twins laugh]

00:00:18.417 --> 00:00:19.708
[door closes]

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:28.374
Uh, Jessie. The wedding got me thinking...

00:00:28.375 --> 00:00:29.791
Shh. Something's off.

00:00:29.792 --> 00:00:31.999
So, how'd the wedding go?

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.666
Who murdered the maid of honor this time?

00:00:33.667 --> 00:00:35.874
Mom? Dad?

00:00:35.875 --> 00:00:37.167
Yeah, sweetie?

00:00:39.083 --> 00:00:41.749
Why won't anyone be my friend?

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:43.207
[all gasp]

00:00:43.208 --> 00:00:46.167
- Oh, Bonnie, come here.
- Oh, sweetie.

00:00:51.417 --> 00:00:53.041
- Buzz.
- Ow.

00:00:53.042 --> 00:00:54.707
You're deputy till I get back.

00:00:54.708 --> 00:00:55.874
Me? Right.

00:00:55.875 --> 00:00:59.332
I'm gonna get those twins
to play with Bonnie somehow.

00:00:59.333 --> 00:01:00.708
Come on, Bullseye.

00:01:02.833 --> 00:01:04.833
[♪ adventurous music playing]

00:01:15.208 --> 00:01:17.208
[♪ ominous music playing]

00:01:18.292 --> 00:01:19.292
Huh?

00:01:20.458 --> 00:01:23.042
Why, they're... they're both
just sitting there.

00:01:24.167 --> 00:01:25.375
Doin' nothing.

00:01:26.333 --> 00:01:28.581
They ain't playing with toys at all.

00:01:28.582 --> 00:01:30.916
What, you didn't hear?

00:01:30.917 --> 00:01:32.666
Uh, n-no, I... I didn't hear.

00:01:32.667 --> 00:01:34.581
- She didn't hear.
- She didn't hear?

00:01:34.582 --> 00:01:36.666
What? What didn't I hear?

00:01:36.667 --> 00:01:38.541
The age of toys is over, lass.

00:01:38.542 --> 00:01:40.666
What do you mean, "over"?
When did that happen?

00:01:40.667 --> 00:01:43.999
It's been happening for years.
Where have you been?

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:46.291
[stammers] Across the street, playing.

00:01:46.292 --> 00:01:47.624
[all] Playing?

00:01:47.625 --> 00:01:49.832
Oh! Your kid still plays?

00:01:49.833 --> 00:01:52.666
I don't remember play. Describe it to me.

00:01:52.667 --> 00:01:55.916
[stammers] Are you guys okay?
What happened to you?

00:01:55.917 --> 00:01:57.999
- [all] Tech!
- Devices!

00:01:58.000 --> 00:01:59.874
Everywhere, devices!

00:01:59.875 --> 00:02:01.707
Phones! Tablets!

00:02:01.708 --> 00:02:03.207
Computers! Cameras!

00:02:03.208 --> 00:02:04.707
The screens just took over!

00:02:04.708 --> 00:02:06.749
All the tapping. The tapping!

00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:08.707
Tap, tap, tap, tap.

00:02:08.708 --> 00:02:10.582
- Make it stop.
- The tapping. Not the tapping!

00:02:10.583 --> 00:02:12.124
Take our advice, darlin'.

00:02:12.125 --> 00:02:13.791
Find a drawer and hide,

00:02:13.792 --> 00:02:15.457
'cause once tech invades your home,

00:02:15.458 --> 00:02:17.124
you're dead where you lie.

00:02:17.125 --> 00:02:20.957
[chuckles] Oh, well,
it's probably just a fad.

00:02:20.958 --> 00:02:23.999
Like, you know, record players
or Hula-Hoops.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:25.541
You don't get it.

00:02:25.542 --> 00:02:27.707
The age of toys is over.

00:02:27.708 --> 00:02:28.957
Over.

00:02:28.958 --> 00:02:31.374
Tap, tap, tap...

00:02:31.375 --> 00:02:35.250
Don't believe us? Come see for yourself.

00:02:37.542 --> 00:02:40.042
[Jessie groaning, grunting]

00:02:41.292 --> 00:02:43.417
- [grunts, gasps]
- [grunts]

00:02:44.917 --> 00:02:46.542
[Jessie] Look at 'em all.

00:02:47.875 --> 00:02:50.125
All on devices.

00:02:52.792 --> 00:02:54.749
Except for Bonnie.

00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:55.832
[sighs]

00:02:55.833 --> 00:02:58.249
No wonder she can't
make a friend, Bullseye.

00:02:58.250 --> 00:03:01.625
She's the only one out there
still playing with toys.

00:03:02.250 --> 00:03:03.541
[sighs]

00:03:03.542 --> 00:03:06.708
- Don't worry. We're safe.
- [giggles]

00:03:07.375 --> 00:03:07.874
Play
Games!

00:03:07.875 --> 00:03:09.207
Make
Friends!

00:03:09.208 --> 00:03:10.124
Hi! I'm Lily

00:03:10.125 --> 00:03:11.457
Are we sure about this?

00:03:11.458 --> 00:03:14.749
[sighs] No, but I think it might help.

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:16.582
[sighs] Okay.

00:03:16.583 --> 00:03:17.499
BUY NOW

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:18.417
[phone chimes]

00:03:18.958 --> 00:03:19.791
[gasps]

00:03:19.792 --> 00:03:21.291
Connect with friends!

00:03:21.292 --> 00:03:23.124
A Lilypad! Oh, thank you, Mom.
Thank you, Dad.

00:03:23.125 --> 00:03:25.833
Well, now that you're eight,
we thought you were ready.

00:03:27.708 --> 00:03:28.541
Hi!

00:03:28.542 --> 00:03:30.457
<i>Hi, there. I'm Lilypad.
Welcome to The Pond.</i>

00:03:30.458 --> 00:03:32.666
You can take today
to figure out how to use it,

00:03:32.667 --> 00:03:34.374
but then tomorrow, we'll start having

00:03:34.375 --> 00:03:36.375
- strict screen time.
- [Bonnie] Uh-huh.

00:03:39.542 --> 00:03:40.625
[Bullseye grunts]

00:03:42.917 --> 00:03:45.417
[Lilypad beeping]

00:03:46.208 --> 00:03:49.333
[chuckles] <i>Uh-oh, try again.</i>

00:03:50.375 --> 00:03:51.957
<i>Keep hopping.</i>

00:03:51.958 --> 00:03:53.708
[frog croaking]

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:56.541
[beeping continues]

00:03:56.542 --> 00:03:58.042
<i>Try again.</i>

00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:08.167
Morning. Screen time's over now.

00:04:08.792 --> 00:04:10.666
Let's put Lilypad away
and come to breakfast.

00:04:10.667 --> 00:04:12.042
Okay.

00:04:18.917 --> 00:04:20.332
[Hamm] We can't let that thing replace us.

00:04:20.333 --> 00:04:23.292
Jumpin' jelly beans!
Will y'all just settle down?

00:04:23.833 --> 00:04:26.874
Now, I'm gonna have some words
with this Lilypad

00:04:26.875 --> 00:04:28.957
and let her know how
things are run around here.

00:04:28.958 --> 00:04:31.416
- Try to stay calm, Jessie.
- Buzz, you know me.

00:04:31.417 --> 00:04:33.041
I'm the definition of calm.

00:04:33.042 --> 00:04:34.291
- [whinnies]
- [Buzz laughs]

00:04:34.292 --> 00:04:35.541
That's not gonna work.

00:04:35.542 --> 00:04:36.500
[grunts]

00:04:40.458 --> 00:04:41.583
[Bullseye grunts]

00:04:43.125 --> 00:04:44.499
- Hi!
- What the--

00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:48.041
Sorry. I didn't mean to scare you.
Sleep mode, you know?

00:04:48.042 --> 00:04:49.957
No? Eh, forget it.

00:04:49.958 --> 00:04:51.374
I was just gonna hop on the charger.

00:04:51.375 --> 00:04:53.041
Battery could use a little refresh.

00:04:53.042 --> 00:04:55.832
- I wanna talk to you, device.
- Please, call me "Lily."

00:04:55.833 --> 00:04:58.374
Now look here. Me and the toys
have been working all summer

00:04:58.375 --> 00:05:00.999
to try and get Bonnie to make
friends with the Jordan twins

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:02.541
- across the street.
- Uh-huh. Yeah.

00:05:02.542 --> 00:05:04.249
- Then you had to ruin it...
- Got it.

00:05:04.250 --> 00:05:05.374
...with all your stupid...

00:05:05.375 --> 00:05:06.541
You're not even listening

00:05:06.542 --> 00:05:07.499
- to me!
- Oh, no.

00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:10.457
I was listening.
I'm always listening. See?

00:05:10.458 --> 00:05:12.666
<i>Now look here. Me and the toys
have been working all summer</i>

00:05:12.667 --> 00:05:14.499
<i>to try to get Bonnie to make
friends with the Jordan twins.</i>

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:15.749
Now in Spanish.

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:17.583
- [speaking Spanish]
- [all gasp]

00:05:18.167 --> 00:05:19.416
- Now as a rap.
- [♪ drumbeat playing]

00:05:19.417 --> 00:05:21.124
<i>♪ Me and the toys
Been working all summer ♪</i>

00:05:21.125 --> 00:05:22.374
<i>♪ Trying to get Bonnie
To make friends ♪</i>

00:05:22.375 --> 00:05:23.707
Ooh! Our first dance, honey!

00:05:23.708 --> 00:05:25.750
Oh, this concerns me ethically.

00:05:26.625 --> 00:05:27.624
[♪ drumbeat stops]

00:05:27.625 --> 00:05:29.707
Whatever. You don't understand.

00:05:29.708 --> 00:05:31.791
Our kid needs to learn
how to make friends,

00:05:31.792 --> 00:05:33.749
and your screen ain't helping.

00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:36.166
Look, if it's friends Bonnie needs,
consider it done.

00:05:36.167 --> 00:05:38.082
- [chimes]
- There.

00:05:38.083 --> 00:05:40.332
What? [stammers] What happened?

00:05:40.333 --> 00:05:42.416
Oh, it was easy. I just
sent a friend request

00:05:42.417 --> 00:05:44.541
to all the girls in Bonnie's dance class.

00:05:44.542 --> 00:05:46.374
But that's... They're not here.

00:05:46.375 --> 00:05:48.832
Oh, yes, they are, silly.

00:05:48.833 --> 00:05:51.541
Chelsea, Kara and even Heidi,
they're all here.

00:05:51.542 --> 00:05:54.166
The parents created
a group chat on The Pond.

00:05:54.167 --> 00:05:55.291
You see, on The Pond,

00:05:55.292 --> 00:05:57.416
while Bonnie's playing
my fun learning games,

00:05:57.417 --> 00:05:59.207
she can also socialize with other kids.

00:05:59.208 --> 00:06:02.333
That's why Mom and Dad bought
me. To make connections.

00:06:03.708 --> 00:06:06.374
- Voilà! Friend made.
- [all exclaim]

00:06:06.375 --> 00:06:07.457
I want one.

00:06:07.458 --> 00:06:09.999
That Lilypad made Bonnie
a friend in, like...

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:11.541
Fifteen seconds. I was counting.

00:06:11.542 --> 00:06:13.374
- What? No.
- No touching.

00:06:13.375 --> 00:06:16.291
That ain't a friend. A real
friend would actually be here.

00:06:16.292 --> 00:06:17.374
Well, that's my point, Jessica.

00:06:17.375 --> 00:06:18.291
[gasps]

00:06:18.292 --> 00:06:20.041
- Oh, no.
- [Hamm] She used the "J" word.

00:06:20.042 --> 00:06:21.124
[Rex] Scandal!

00:06:21.125 --> 00:06:23.207
With my help, eventually Bonnie can reach

00:06:23.208 --> 00:06:24.791
all of her developmental goals.

00:06:24.792 --> 00:06:26.374
I just want what's best for her.

00:06:26.375 --> 00:06:28.541
I think I know more
than a green calculator

00:06:28.542 --> 00:06:29.874
what's best for Bonnie.

00:06:29.875 --> 00:06:31.832
- Uh, really?
- Yeah, really.

00:06:31.833 --> 00:06:33.874
I got three kids' worth of know-how.

00:06:33.875 --> 00:06:38.541
Bonnie. Before that, Andy,
and before that, Emily.

00:06:38.542 --> 00:06:40.582
I think that just means you're old.

00:06:40.583 --> 00:06:43.041
Yikes! Wow. Really old.

00:06:43.042 --> 00:06:44.582
Fine. We'll wrestle for her.

00:06:44.583 --> 00:06:46.874
- Hi-yah! Come on!
- Whoa! [chuckling]

00:06:46.875 --> 00:06:48.332
Wrestle me, you frog-faced faker.

00:06:48.333 --> 00:06:49.499
That kinda tickles.

00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:51.082
- I'll knock ya off this bed.
- I thought we were

00:06:51.083 --> 00:06:53.166
- staying calm-- Ah!
- Put up a fight, you riffraff.

00:06:53.167 --> 00:06:54.749
- Whoa!
- I'll show you who's better

00:06:54.750 --> 00:06:55.666
- for Bonnie.
- Okay.

00:06:55.667 --> 00:06:57.332
Nobody said anything about lifting.

00:06:57.333 --> 00:06:59.292
- [Dad] Bonnie?
- [Bonnie] Just a sec.

